// The farm (P3 pieces, refs owner-approved under A17) on meadow_base's grass, ahead of the P3
// recipes (owner request, 2026-10-19). Grass edges, so it mixes freely with meadows. The red barn
// stands along edge 5 with its back corner 0.5 m inside the border, its doors (local +x) turned
// toward the hay; the bales and the animals stand where the meadow relief
// (`relief()` in scripts/blender/kit/meadow_base.py) is flattest (the hero props stand at y = 0):
// no bale floats, and no hoof of the standing animals floats more than 2 cm. The grazing animals
// keep the standing ones' spots and float more (animal_cow_b 3.9 cm, animal_sheep_c 2.8 cm; owner
// Q42 and Q57 open). A hay slot may draw its variant (hex_core::HERO_VARIANTS: hay_bale_round_b,
// hay_bale_stack_b), whose straw and foot are built on the relief of these slots, and the barn slot
// may draw barn_red_b, which stands inside barn_red's collider box. Do not reorder the heroes: the
// slot index picks the variant. The animals, standing (animal_cow, animal_sheep) and grazing
// (animal_cow_b, animal_sheep_b, animal_sheep_c), stand still in the paddock until P3's wander.
// The paddock fence is the last hero, at the tile origin: three-rail runs round the animals with a
// 3 m gate toward the yard. Its collider is one box per run, so the walker stops at the rails and
// enters through the gate; grass clears only a disc at each post, and scatter drops the instances
// that land on the fence line.
// No wheat: the wheat field is its own tile (wheat_field.ron). A light drift of wildflowers and a
// few rocks keep clear of every hero by scatter's footprints.
(
    id: "farm",
    biome: Grass,
    base: "meadow_base",
    edges: (
        (kind: Grass),
        (kind: Grass),
        (kind: Grass),
        (kind: Grass),
        (kind: Grass),
        (kind: Grass),
    ),
    props: (
        scatter: [
            (piece: "wildflower_clump", density: 1.2, drift: true),
            (piece: "rock_small", density: 0.3),
        ],
        hero: [
            (piece: "barn_red", at: (4.75, -8.227), yaw_deg: 30.0),
            (piece: "hay_bale_stack", at: (8.9, -2.4), yaw_deg: 30.0),
            (piece: "hay_bale_round", at: (7.5, -0.4), yaw_deg: 15.0),
            (piece: "hay_bale_round", at: (10.4, -1.4), yaw_deg: 30.0),
            (piece: "animal_cow", at: (0.25, 8.25), yaw_deg: 255.0),
            (piece: "animal_sheep", at: (-0.5, 10.75), yaw_deg: 45.0),
            (piece: "animal_sheep", at: (-2.25, 11.25), yaw_deg: 345.0),
            (piece: "animal_cow_b", at: (0.5, 7.0), yaw_deg: 75.0),
            (piece: "animal_sheep_b", at: (-1.25, 9.625), yaw_deg: 30.0),
            (piece: "animal_sheep_c", at: (-2.25, 9.625), yaw_deg: 210.0),
            (piece: "fence_paddock", at: (0.0, 0.0), yaw_deg: 0.0),
        ],
    ),
)
